    },
    {
      "id": "claim_7e048db86cbf4311a9ecd0a95b9e881c",
      "statement": "OutboxPoller exposes a StateFlow with states IDLE, POLLING, DELIVERING, ERROR; GatewayService mirrors it into the persistent notification (live / delivering / retrying… / idle, blank when no URL is set) and exposes it app-wide via bridgeStateFlow so a dark bridge is diagnosable from the lock screen rather than only inside the gateway screen.",
      "evidence": [
