    {
      "id": "claim_36e22d4d2ea84b468bc08a7d5232cb92",
      "statement": "The legacy OutboxPoller (/gateway/pull + EveSmsQueue) coexists with the newer PR-10 SecureCommandPoller, which is the strategic outbound-only HTTPS long-poll against GMweb's /api/v1/agent/commands/claim built on the durable remote_commands queue; OutboxPoller remains the compatibility transport while the executor learns to drain remote_commands.",
